            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/97cfb3a12c36b5819d56e86a5fae3b6e.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/97cfb3a12c36b5819d56e86a5fae3b6e.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/97cfb3a12c36b5819d56e86a5fae3b6e.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THERE'S VIKINGS IN THE AIR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as vikings, fight on trampolines in this accessible co-op / versus brawler. Work together in Adventure mode to battle devious balloons, giant bosses and mischievous minigames! Or, go berserk on each other in Versus Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/117bab892fbf65c85eab9c8b3c046111.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/117bab892fbf65c85eab9c8b3c046111.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/117bab892fbf65c85eab9c8b3c046111.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIMPLE CONTROLS - SIMPLE FUN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage is all about trampolines! Stay off the ground and keep bouncing, that's it! With a bit of practice and timing, you'll be able to pull off special moves as you battle your way through the air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/09bbfb691b9aa0ca89087c2499820129.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/09bbfb691b9aa0ca89087c2499820129.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/09bbfb691b9aa0ca89087c2499820129.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLY ONE HAND NEEDED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vikings on Trampolines' unique controls lets you play the entire game (yes, ALL OF IT!) using only directional inputs, no buttons needed! Play solo or local multiplayer for up to 4 players in either co-op adventure or Versus brawls! Did we mention team sport modes as well?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/35942b7aa511e43af99c55cdb7292f60.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/35942b7aa511e43af99c55cdb7292f60.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/35942b7aa511e43af99c55cdb7292f60.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BALLOONS ARE EVIL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Adventure Mode, the vikings must rescue their spellbound king from the clutches of Balloonie and his rotten balloon henchmen! Bounce your way through worlds filled with challenging stages, minigames and giant boss fights! Unlock secrets and new characters as you explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/82e6ac30963060446ffffbe7c3b73cba.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEWARE THE BEASTS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you reach the end of each island, prepare for a massive challenge! Gigantic beasts have been turned against you by Balloonie's forces. Will you take them down, or will you survive at all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/7d741d4d7180e0b63fc86e1555d11118.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/7d741d4d7180e0b63fc86e1555d11118.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/7d741d4d7180e0b63fc86e1555d11118.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY LOCAL OR ONLINE VIA REMOTE PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together (or against?) your friends locally in couch co-op or online through <i>Steam Remote Play Together</i>! Simply boot the game and invite anyone on your friends list to play. <strong>And the best part</strong> - only <u><i>one</i></u> of you need to own the game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STAY ON THOSE TRAMPOLINES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trampoline skills to battle your friends using a variety of items across diverse stages in <i>Versus Mode</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/e9a6ea4ea203bb4f5ac05567682e0e74.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=600 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/e9a6ea4ea203bb4f5ac05567682e0e74.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/e9a6ea4ea203bb4f5ac05567682e0e74.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathtaking pixel art, a catchy soundtrack and pick-up-and-play controls; Get ready for a crazy adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/8ee0284f0ec1dd4899b3910329e79256.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/8ee0284f0ec1dd4899b3910329e79256.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/8ee0284f0ec1dd4899b3910329e79256.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to connect with the devs? Check out the D-Pad Studio Discord (link in side-panel)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/f1fa11c3515bc61010581846cd0a2c45.avif?t=1789888447\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/97cfb3a12c36b5819d56e86a5fae3b6e.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/97cfb3a12c36b5819d56e86a5fae3b6e.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/97cfb3a12c36b5819d56e86a5fae3b6e.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THERE'S VIKINGS IN THE AIR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as vikings, fight on trampolines in this accessible co-op / versus brawler. Work together in Adventure mode to battle devious balloons, giant bosses and mischievous minigames! Or, go berserk on each other in Versus Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/117bab892fbf65c85eab9c8b3c046111.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/117bab892fbf65c85eab9c8b3c046111.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/117bab892fbf65c85eab9c8b3c046111.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIMPLE CONTROLS - SIMPLE FUN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage is all about trampolines! Stay off the ground and keep bouncing, that's it! With a bit of practice and timing, you'll be able to pull off special moves as you battle your way through the air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/09bbfb691b9aa0ca89087c2499820129.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/09bbfb691b9aa0ca89087c2499820129.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/09bbfb691b9aa0ca89087c2499820129.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLY ONE HAND NEEDED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vikings on Trampolines' unique controls lets you play the entire game (yes, ALL OF IT!) using only directional inputs, no buttons needed! Play solo or local multiplayer for up to 4 players in either co-op adventure or Versus brawls! Did we mention team sport modes as well?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/35942b7aa511e43af99c55cdb7292f60.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/35942b7aa511e43af99c55cdb7292f60.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/35942b7aa511e43af99c55cdb7292f60.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BALLOONS ARE EVIL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Adventure Mode, the vikings must rescue their spellbound king from the clutches of Balloonie and his rotten balloon henchmen! Bounce your way through worlds filled with challenging stages, minigames and giant boss fights! Unlock secrets and new characters as you explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/82e6ac30963060446ffffbe7c3b73cba.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEWARE THE BEASTS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you reach the end of each island, prepare for a massive challenge! Gigantic beasts have been turned against you by Balloonie's forces. Will you take them down, or will you survive at all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/7d741d4d7180e0b63fc86e1555d11118.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/7d741d4d7180e0b63fc86e1555d11118.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/7d741d4d7180e0b63fc86e1555d11118.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY LOCAL OR ONLINE VIA REMOTE PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together (or against?) your friends locally in couch co-op or online through <i>Steam Remote Play Together</i>! Simply boot the game and invite anyone on your friends list to play. <strong>And the best part</strong> - only <u><i>one</i></u> of you need to own the game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STAY ON THOSE TRAMPOLINES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trampoline skills to battle your friends using a variety of items across diverse stages in <i>Versus Mode</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/e9a6ea4ea203bb4f5ac05567682e0e74.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=600 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/e9a6ea4ea203bb4f5ac05567682e0e74.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/e9a6ea4ea203bb4f5ac05567682e0e74.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breathtaking pixel art, a catchy soundtrack and pick-up-and-play controls; Get ready for a crazy adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/8ee0284f0ec1dd4899b3910329e79256.poster.avif?t=1789888447\" width=612 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/8ee0284f0ec1dd4899b3910329e79256.webm?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/8ee0284f0ec1dd4899b3910329e79256.mp4?t=1789888447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to connect with the devs? Check out the D-Pad Studio Discord (link in side-panel)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/748810/extras/f1fa11c3515bc61010581846cd0a2c45.avif?t=1789888447\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p>",
